invariant: INV-63
file: srv_parser.c
catches: tcp_blocking_loop_test
reason: the parser seeds the selected protocol with index 0, the first
  name on the server's ALPN list, so a hello that offered no ALPN gets an
  EncryptedExtensions that names one. RFC 9846 §4.3 forbids that reply
  (rfc9846.txt:1582-1587). test_reply_extensions reads the length of that
  message's record for a hello without the extension.

--- old
    ch->alpn_selected = CH_ALPN_NONE;

    rbuf r;
--- new
    ch->alpn_selected = 0;

    rbuf r;
